Output docs/invoice-extraction.gif
Set FontFamily "DejaVu Sans Mono"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 780
Set Padding 28
Set Framerate 12
Set TypingSpeed 28ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "export PS1='skills $ '"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Type "python3 scripts/demo_invoice.py"
Enter
Sleep 4s
